<title>NETHERLANDS: SCHUTTERSVELD 1996 NET UP 20 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>SCHUTTERSVELD 1996 NET UP 20 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.50 vs   5.80</p>
<p>    Net profit			    30.2  vs  25.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.90 vs   1.70</p>
<p>    Turnover			     964.5  vs 808.4</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    58.0  vs  53.8</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    12.0  vs  13.9</p>
<p>    Tax				     14.6  vs  13.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial group Schuttersveld Holding NV previously</p>
<p>said it expected a 1996 full-year net of about 30 mln guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
